---
import Controls from './Controls.astro';
---
<figure class="placement-figure wide" data-placement-write aria-labelledby="placement-write-title">
  <figcaption id="placement-write-title"><span>Figure 2</span> <strong>The remote reply that completes a majority</strong></figcaption>
  <div class="placement-panel">
    <div class="placement-options"><label>North voter <select data-north><option value="up">Available · 40 ms RTT</option><option value="down">Unavailable · use East at 90 ms</option></select></label></div>
    <div class="placement-regions">
      {['West','North','East'].map((region,i)=><div class="placement-replica" data-copy={region}>
        <b>{region}{i===0?' · leader':''}</b><span data-record data-live>Earlier history</span><strong data-price data-live>20.00 applied</strong>
      </div>)}
    </div>
    <div class="placement-message" data-message="0"><span>① West → North</span><b>Send U; await durable acknowledgement</b><span class="placement-track"><i style="width:44.44%"></i></span><small>40 ms assumed round trip</small></div>
    <div class="placement-message" data-message="1"><span>② West → East</span><b>Send U; await durable acknowledgement</b><span class="placement-track"><i style="width:100%"></i></span><small>90 ms assumed round trip</small></div>
    <p class="placement-result" data-agreement data-live>0 of 2 required durable records established</p>
    <p class="placement-explanation" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">U has reached West. It means “set P7 catalogue price to 22.00”.</p>
    <Controls label="Figure 2 controls" />
  </div>
  <p class="placement-caption">One voter per region; West is already leader. The two sends run in parallel; the healthy branch assumes North supplies the first useful acknowledgement. Bar lengths compare the assumed network round trips only; stage spacing has no time scale. Solid record outlines mark durable U; applied prices are shown separately. U is a new current-term command. This is one shard’s agreement round, not a SQL transaction trace.</p>
  <details><summary>Both acknowledgement paths as text</summary><ol>
    <li>U arrives at West. All applied prices are 20.00.</li>
    <li>West records U durably. One record alone is insufficient.</li>
    <li>West sends U to both remote voters in parallel. North is unavailable in the failure branch.</li>
    <li>Healthy: North’s durable acknowledgement completes West’s majority; its network round trip is 40 ms. North unavailable: East’s durable acknowledgement completes it, with a 90 ms network round trip. The other follower’s progress is not established here.</li>
    <li>West establishes commitment, applies 22.00 and can reply under this model. Acknowledging followers need not have applied U yet.</li>
  </ol></details>
</figure>
<script>
  import { stepper } from '../figures/stepper.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-placement-write]').forEach(root=>{
    const north=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-north]')!;
    const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>5,draw:(step:number)=>{
      const down=north.value==='down', chosen=down?'East':'North', rtt=down?90:40;
      ['West','North','East'].forEach((region,i)=>{
        const copy=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-copy="${region}"]`)!;
        const lost=down&&region==='North';
        const durable=!lost&&((i===0&&step>=1)||(region===chosen&&step>=3));
        copy.classList.toggle('is-lost',lost);copy.classList.toggle('is-durable',durable);
        copy.querySelector('[data-record]')!.textContent=lost?'Unavailable':durable?'U durable':step>=2&&i>0?'U sent · progress unknown':'Earlier history';
        copy.querySelector('[data-price]')!.textContent=lost?'Applied state unavailable':i===0&&step===4?'22.00 applied':i>0&&region!==chosen&&step>=2?'Applied state not established':'20.00 applied';
      });
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-message]').forEach((el,i)=>{
        el.classList.toggle('is-active',step>=2);el.classList.toggle('is-lost',down&&i===0);
      });
      root.querySelector('[data-agreement]')!.textContent=step<1?'0 of 2 required durable records established':step<3?'1 of 2 · West alone':`2 of 2 · West + ${chosen} · network contribution ≥ ${rtt} ms`;
      root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=[
        'U has reached West. It means “set P7 catalogue price to 22.00”.',
        'West records U durably. Its own record counts, but one voter is short of the required majority of two.',
        down?'West sends U to both followers. North is unavailable; East must supply the second durable acknowledgement.':'West sends U to North and East in parallel. It needs one remote durable acknowledgement, not both.',
        `${chosen} records U durably and acknowledges. West now has two durable records. The assumed network contribution is at least ${rtt} ms; storage and other work are additional.`,
        `West establishes commitment and applies U, then can reply 22.00. ${chosen}’s durable acknowledgement did not require its applied price to have changed yet.`,
      ][step];
    }});
    north.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render());
  });
</script>
